{"seq":1,"slug":"top-down-parsing","title":"自顶向下解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/top-down-parsing","wordCount":1494,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"自顶向下解析\">自顶向下解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自顶向下解析（Top-Down Parsing）从文法的起始符号出发，尝试通过反复应用产生式规则来推导出输入的 token 序列。解析过程构造的是一棵<strong>最左推导</strong>的解析树——从根节点（起始符号）开始，逐步展开左侧的非终结符，直到叶节点全部匹配输入 token。</p>\n<p>自顶向下解析的核心挑战是<strong>预测问题</strong>：面对当前非终结符和下一个输入 token，如何选择正确的产生式？如果每一步都能确定唯一的产生式，就是确定性的自顶向下解析。否则就需要回溯。</p>\n<p>实践中，递归下降（Recursive Descent）是最常用的自顶向下解析技术。手写编译器几乎都采用递归下降，因为它直觉、灵活、容易实现高质量的错误恢复。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[起始符号 S] --&gt; B{选择产生式}&#10;    B --&gt; C[展开第一个非终结符]&#10;    C --&gt; D{匹配输入 token?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[继续下一个符号]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[回溯或报错]&#10;    E --&gt; G{所有符号匹配?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[解析成功]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| C\">graph TD\n    A[起始符号 S] --&gt; B{选择产生式}\n    B --&gt; C[展开第一个非终结符]\n    C --&gt; D{匹配输入 token?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[继续下一个符号]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[回溯或报错]\n    E --&gt; G{所有符号匹配?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[解析成功]\n    G --&gt;|否| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>预测方式</th>\n<th>回溯</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归下降</td>\n<td>手工编码</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>GCC、Clang、Go、Rust</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LL(1)</td>\n<td>FIRST/FOLLOW 集</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>教学、简单语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LL(k)</td>\n<td>k 个前看符号</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>ANTLR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PEG</td>\n<td>有序选择</td>\n<td>无（总选第一个成功的）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>packrat 解析器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"递归下降解析器\">递归下降解析器</h2><p>递归下降解析器为文法中的每个非终结符定义一个解析函数。每个函数根据当前的前看 token 决定使用哪条产生式，然后按产生式右部的顺序调用其他解析函数或匹配终结符。</p>\n<p>以算术表达式文法为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"expr   → term ((&quot;+&quot; | &quot;-&quot;) term)*&#10;term   → factor ((&quot;*&quot; | &quot;/&quot;) factor)*&#10;factor → &quot;(&quot; expr &quot;)&quot; | NUMBER | IDENT\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>expr   → term ((\"+\" | \"-\") term)*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term   → factor ((\"*\" | \"/\") factor)*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factor → \"(\" expr \")\" | NUMBER | IDENT</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对应的递归下降代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function parseExpr(): ASTNode {&#10;  let left = parseTerm();&#10;  while (current() === PLUS || current() === MINUS) {&#10;    const op = advance();&#10;    const right = parseTerm();&#10;    left = { type: &#39;BinaryExpr&#39;, op, left, right };&#10;  }&#10;  return left;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function parseTerm(): ASTNode {&#10;  let left = parseFactor();&#10;  while (current() === STAR || current() === SLASH) {&#10;    const op = advance();&#10;    const right = parseFactor();&#10;    left = { type: &#39;BinaryExpr&#39;, op, left, right };&#10;  }&#10;  return left;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function parseFactor(): ASTNode {&#10;  if (current() === LPAREN) {&#10;    advance();&#10;    const expr = parseExpr();&#10;    expect(RPAREN);&#10;    return expr;&#10;  }&#10;  if (current() === NUMBER) return { type: &#39;NumLit&#39;, value: advance() };&#10;  if (current() === IDENT) return { type: &#39;Ident&#39;, name: advance() };&#10;  throw new ParseError(&#39;unexpected token&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseExpr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseTerm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PLUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MINUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> op</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseTerm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BinaryExpr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, op, left, right };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseTerm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> STAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SLASH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> op</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BinaryExpr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, op, left, right };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LPAREN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> expr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseExpr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">RPAREN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NumLit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, value: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IDENT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Ident'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ParseError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unexpected token'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意这个实现使用了<strong>循环</strong>代替左递归。原始文法 <code>E → E + T | T</code> 是左递归的，直接翻译为递归函数会导致无限递归。消除左递归后改写为 <code>E → T (+ T)*</code>，然后用 <code>while</code> 循环实现重复部分。</p>\n<p>递归下降的优势在于代码即文法——解析函数的结构直接映射文法规则。这使得阅读、调试和修改解析器变得非常自然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-集与-follow-集\">FIRST 集与 FOLLOW 集</h2><p>LL 解析器通过 FIRST 和 FOLLOW 集来确定性地选择产生式。</p>\n<p><strong>FIRST(α)</strong> 是符号串 α 可能推导出的所有第一个终结符的集合。如果 α 可以推导出空串 ε，则 ε ∈ FIRST(α)。</p>\n<p><strong>FOLLOW(A)</strong> 是非终结符 A 之后可能出现的所有终结符的集合。如果 A 可以出现在输入末尾，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>（</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">∈ FOLLOW(A)（</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">LL</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span></span></span></span></span> 表示输入结束符）。</p>\n<p>计算规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"FIRST 集计算:&#10;- 终结符 a: FIRST(a) = {a}&#10;- 产生式 A → a...: a ∈ FIRST(A)&#10;- 产生式 A → B...: FIRST(B) ⊆ FIRST(A)&#10;- 产生式 A → ε: ε ∈ FIRST(A)&#10;- 产生式 A → B₁B₂...Bₙ: 如果 ε ∈ FIRST(B₁...Bᵢ₋₁)，&#10;  则 FIRST(Bᵢ) \\ {ε} ⊆ FIRST(A)&#10;&#10;FOLLOW 集计算:&#10;- $ ∈ FOLLOW(S)  (S 是起始符号)&#10;- 产生式 A → αBβ: FIRST(β) \\ {ε} ⊆ FOLLOW(B)&#10;- 产生式 A → αB 或 A → αBβ 且 ε ∈ FIRST(β):&#10;  FOLLOW(A) ⊆ FOLLOW(B)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FIRST 集计算:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 终结符 a: FIRST(a) = {a}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → a...: a ∈ FIRST(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → B...: FIRST(B) ⊆ FIRST(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → ε: ε ∈ FIRST(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → B₁B₂...Bₙ: 如果 ε ∈ FIRST(B₁...Bᵢ₋₁)，</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  则 FIRST(Bᵢ) \\ {ε} ⊆ FIRST(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FOLLOW 集计算:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- $ ∈ FOLLOW(S)  (S 是起始符号)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → αBβ: FIRST(β) \\ {ε} ⊆ FOLLOW(B)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 产生式 A → αB 或 A → αBβ 且 ε ∈ FIRST(β):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  FOLLOW(A) ⊆ FOLLOW(B)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>FIRST 和 FOLLOW 集用于构造 LL(1) 解析表：对产生式 A → α，将其填入表格 M[A, t] 中所有 t ∈ FIRST(α) 的位置。如果 ε ∈ FIRST(α)，还要填入 M[A, t] 中所有 t ∈ FOLLOW(A) 的位置。</p>\n<p>如果任何表格项有多个产生式，则文法不是 LL(1) 的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ll-1-解析表与驱动程序\">LL(1) 解析表与驱动程序</h2><p>LL(1) 解析器使用预测解析表 M 和一个显式的栈来模拟最左推导过程。&quot;LL(1)&quot;含义：从<strong>L</strong>eft 到右扫描输入，构造<strong>L</strong>eftmost 推导，使用 <strong>1</strong> 个前看符号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LL(1) 驱动程序:&#10;&#10;stack = [S, $]&#10;input = token 序列 + $&#10;&#10;while stack.top() != $:&#10;    X = stack.top()&#10;    a = current input token&#10;&#10;    if X == a:                    // 终结符匹配&#10;        stack.pop()&#10;        advance()&#10;    else if X 是终结符:           // 不匹配&#10;        error()&#10;    else if M[X, a] == X → Y₁Y₂...Yₖ:  // 查表&#10;        stack.pop()&#10;        push Yₖ, ..., Y₂, Y₁   // 逆序压栈&#10;    else:&#10;        error()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LL(1) 驱动程序:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stack = [S, $]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>input = token 序列 + $</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>while stack.top() != $:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    X = stack.top()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    a = current input token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if X == a:                    // 终结符匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stack.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advance()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if X 是终结符:           // 不匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        error()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if M[X, a] == X → Y₁Y₂...Yₖ:  // 查表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stack.pop()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        push Yₖ, ..., Y₂, Y₁   // 逆序压栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        error()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>以文法 <code>E → T E&#39;</code>, <code>E&#39; → + T E&#39; | ε</code>, <code>T → F T&#39;</code>, <code>T&#39; → * F T&#39; | ε</code>, <code>F → ( E ) | id</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>id</th>\n<th>+</th>\n<th>*</th>\n<th>(</th>\n<th>)</th>\n<th>$</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>E→TE&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>E→TE&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>E&#39;→+TE&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>E&#39;→ε</td>\n<td>E&#39;→ε</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>T→FT&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>T→FT&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>T&#39;→ε</td>\n<td>T&#39;→*FT&#39;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>T&#39;→ε</td>\n<td>T&#39;→ε</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>F→id</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>F→(E)</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LL(1) 的限制是只看一个前看符号，这导致很多实用文法不是 LL(1) 的。例如 C 语言中的声明和表达式语句在语法上共享前缀 <code>IDENT</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ll-k-与-all-解析\">LL(k) 与 ALL(*) 解析</h2><p>为了克服 LL(1) 的限制，可以增加前看符号的数量。</p>\n<p><strong>LL(k)</strong> 使用 k 个前看符号。解析表的列从单个 token 扩展为 k 个 token 的序列。k 增大使得更多文法可以被确定性解析，但解析表的大小以 |Σ|^k 增长。</p>\n<p><strong>LL(*)</strong> 是 ANTLR 3 引入的概念，允许根据需要前看任意多个 token。当有限个前看符号不够时，LL(*) 会在多条候选产生式的前缀上构造 DFA 来选择。</p>\n<p><strong>ALL(*)</strong> （Adaptive LL(<em>)）是 ANTLR 4 的核心算法，进一步增强了 LL(</em>)。ALL(*) 在运行时动态分析输入来选择产生式，缓存分析结果供后续使用。它能处理包括间接左递归在内的几乎所有上下文无关文法（通过自动改写左递归）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 解析能力递增&#10;        LL1[LL 1] --&gt; LLK[LL k]&#10;        LLK --&gt; LLS[LL *]&#10;        LLS --&gt; ALLS[ALL *]&#10;    end&#10;    LL1 -.-&gt;|1 个前看| D1[简单文法]&#10;    LLK -.-&gt;|k 个前看| D2[更多文法]&#10;    ALLS -.-&gt;|自适应| D3[几乎所有 CFG]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 解析能力递增\n        LL1[LL 1] --&gt; LLK[LL k]\n        LLK --&gt; LLS[LL *]\n        LLS --&gt; ALLS[ALL *]\n    end\n    LL1 -.-&gt;|1 个前看| D1[简单文法]\n    LLK -.-&gt;|k 个前看| D2[更多文法]\n    ALLS -.-&gt;|自适应| D3[几乎所有 CFG]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>LL(1)</th>\n<th>LL(k)</th>\n<th>LL(*)</th>\n<th>ALL(*)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前看数</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固定 k</td>\n<td>动态无限</td>\n<td>动态自适应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左递归</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>自动改写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析表大小</td>\n<td>O(N×T)</td>\n<td>O(N×Tᵏ)</td>\n<td>按需构造</td>\n<td>按需缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>手写</td>\n<td>手写</td>\n<td>ANTLR 3</td>\n<td>ANTLR 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pratt-解析与运算符优先级\">Pratt 解析与运算符优先级</h2><p><strong>Pratt 解析</strong>（也称为优先级攀升解析）是处理表达式中运算符优先级和结合性的优雅技术。它是递归下降的变体，核心思想是为每个运算符分配一个<strong>绑定力</strong>（Binding Power）。</p>\n<p>Pratt 解析只需要一个主解析函数，通过绑定力控制递归深度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function parseExpression(minBP: number): ASTNode {&#10;  let left = parsePrefix();&#10;&#10;  while (true) {&#10;    const op = current();&#10;    const bp = getInfixBP(op);&#10;    if (bp === undefined || bp.left &lt; minBP) break;&#10;&#10;    advance();&#10;    const right = parseExpression(bp.right);&#10;    left = { type: &#39;BinaryExpr&#39;, op, left, right };&#10;  }&#10;  return left;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 绑定力定义&#10;// 左结合: left &lt; right (如 +: left=1, right=2)&#10;// 右结合: left &gt; right (如 =: left=4, right=3)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minBP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ASTNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parsePrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> op</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getInfixBP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(op);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (bp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bp.left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minBP) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    advance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseExpression</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bp.right);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BinaryExpr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, op, left, right };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 绑定力定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 左结合: left &#x3C; right (如 +: left=1, right=2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 右结合: left > right (如 =: left=4, right=3)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Pratt 解析的优势是优先级和结合性通过数值配置，添加新运算符只需添加一条配置。这比为每个优先级层级创建独立的解析函数（如 parseExpr、parseTerm、parseFactor）更灵活。</p>\n<p>许多现代编译器在表达式解析部分使用 Pratt 技术。Rust 编译器（rustc）的表达式解析就采用了优先级攀升方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((自顶向下解析))&#10;    递归下降&#10;      每个非终结符一个函数&#10;      循环代替左递归&#10;    LL 解析&#10;      FIRST/FOLLOW 集&#10;      LL 1 解析表&#10;      LL k 和 ALL*&#10;    Pratt 解析&#10;      绑定力&#10;      优先级攀升&#10;    工程实践&#10;      手写递归下降为主流&#10;      ANTLR 为自动化首选\">mindmap\n  root((自顶向下解析))\n    递归下降\n      每个非终结符一个函数\n      循环代替左递归\n    LL 解析\n      FIRST/FOLLOW 集\n      LL 1 解析表\n      LL k 和 ALL*\n    Pratt 解析\n      绑定力\n      优先级攀升\n    工程实践\n      手写递归下降为主流\n      ANTLR 为自动化首选</pre><ul>\n<li>自顶向下解析从起始符号出发构造最左推导</li>\n<li>递归下降是最实用的自顶向下技术，主流编译器均采用</li>\n<li>FIRST 和 FOLLOW 集用于确定性地选择产生式</li>\n<li>LL(1) 只看一个前看符号，限制较多但实现简单</li>\n<li>ALL(*) 通过自适应运行时分析几乎能处理所有 CFG</li>\n<li>Pratt 解析通过绑定力优雅地处理运算符优先级</li>\n<li>自顶向下解析的错误恢复通常比自底向上解析更容易实现</li>\n<li>手写递归下降 + Pratt 表达式解析是工业级编译器的主流组合</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自顶向下解析","id":"自顶向下解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"递归下降解析器","id":"递归下降解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"FIRST 集与 FOLLOW 集","id":"first-集与-follow-集"},{"level":2,"text":"LL(1) 解析表与驱动程序","id":"ll-1-解析表与驱动程序"},{"level":2,"text":"LL(k) 与 ALL(\\*) 解析","id":"ll-k-与-all-解析"},{"level":2,"text":"Pratt 解析与运算符优先级","id":"pratt-解析与运算符优先级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"词法生成器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/lexical-analysis/lexer-generators"},"next":{"title":"自底向上解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/compiler-theory/parsing/bottom-up-parsing"}}